{"id":"662230","name":"冬瓜花蛤豆腐汤","author":"圆小π","authorId":"1365842","desc":"","cover":"images/662230/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"花蛤","amount":"适量"},{"name":"冬瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"花蛤刷洗干净表面，加勺盐泡一下，让花蛤吐吐沙。","img":"images/662230/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"烧开水下入花蛤烫开。","img":"images/662230/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"冲洗干净壳里泥沙。","img":"images/662230/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出来控干水分。","img":"images/662230/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"冬瓜清洗干净，去皮切块。豆腐冲洗切块。","img":"images/662230/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"香菜摘洗干净，切碎备用。","img":"images/662230/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"冬瓜和豆腐下入锅中，炖熟。","img":"images/662230/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"下入花蛤煮3分钟。","img":"images/662230/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"下入枸杞，关火。","img":"images/662230/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"撒点香菜碎，加入适量盐调味。清清淡淡一晚汤。","img":"images/662230/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}